// The roads of light: the masons' two sets of ward decks over the chasm east of the plaza, only one set
// standing at a time. Striking any ward crystal swaps them. From the plaza a gold road leads out to the
// first island; island to island they alternate, and the last pale road runs back west to the ledge
// before the Keystone's great door. Every island and both shores keep a crystal, so you can always
// wake the road you need from where you stand.
